 as a source-level package. The minimizer premise here belongs to the ordinary manuscript model; formal-interface hypotheses remain on the separate Lean target. This classification does not prove a transport between formal models.","citation_ids":["support_closure_source","support_closure_lean_source"],"evidence_ids":["support_source_bindings_20261024","support_graph_semantic_review_pending"],"id":"support.full_relative_support","kind":"claim","label":"Exhausting the support complement","locator":"variation.tex:215–243; proof of thm:full-support","source_id":"support_tex_variation","statement":"For an admissible minimizer gamma and every Stieltjes measure mu with the specified cumulative function, S=supp(mu) is relatively closed in [0,1). Every nonempty component of [0,1) minus S is initial, bounded between support points, or terminal; empty support is a terminal-plateau case. Excluding all these cases proves S=[0,1).","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.full_relative_support","relations":[{"derived":true,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.full_relative_support","id":"field:94cff4c777be52df37ae98531975f302a2382e55acc939889785e0fa2180b19c","kind":"assumption_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.full_relative_support","semantic_class":"explicit_assumption_reference","source_field":"assumption_ids","to":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.paper_minimizer"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/full_support","id":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/edges/%5B%22full_support%22%2C%22support.full_relative_support%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:9a43c